    "subtitle": "Explaining a problem · 1",
    "context": "Use the selected vocabulary and constructions to describe a health or bodily concern and clarify the information needed to seek help.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-CORE-U3-09-required-interaction-produce",
        "kind": "check",
        "title": "Respond to the situation",
        "questions": [
          {
            "id": "EX-CORE-U3-09-required-interaction-draft",
            "kind": "production",
            "response": "spoken",
            "prompt": "Explaining a problem · 1: A partner proposes acting immediately on the first part of this account. Explain the later information they need, ask one clarification, and negotiate a suitable next step.",
            "promptLanguage": "en",
            "context": "奶奶住院了。我和妈妈准备去看她，妈妈让我带水，我想再买一点儿吃的。我以为奶奶在医院没有吃饭，一定想吃东西。\n\n到了医院，奶奶说已经吃过了，现在不想吃，想喝水。妈妈把水给她，我没有再去买饭。她让我把杯子放在床旁边。\n\n我问奶奶今天是不是可以回家。她说还不舒服，医生让她再住几天。她的书包放在床下，里面有衣服，不是准备今天出院。\n\n奶奶喝了水，和我们说了一会儿。她有点儿累，妈妈说我们先回家，让她休息。我把床旁边的书拿给她，她说有时间就看。\n\n回家的路上，我说下次先问奶奶想要什么，再准备东西。今天她不需要饭，需要水和休息。妈妈说，来看病人，也要听病人自己说。",
            "contextLanguage": "zh",
            "label": "Take your speaking turn",
            "resultDomain": "Self-reviewed speaking practice",
            "rubric": [
              {
                "id": "r1",
                "text": "My reply uses the later information instead of simply repeating the first claim."
              },
              {
                "id": "r2",
                "text": "My clarification and proposed next step address the practical constraint."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "sequential": true
      }
    ],
